    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:2e780f63f4172747",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "b1ef8871d830809a52c28ac50b475a3c7cbf52eb9f3bd07236ef67aca6b0a0ea",
      "text": "We arrange participants’ departures around each flight schedule. For early transfers from Hyatt Regency to Tocumen Airport, we provide a Mercedes-Benz Sprinter and a separate Mercedes-Benz Vito. For other departures, we select a Mercedes-Benz Vito, Chevrolet Suburban or 45-seat coach according to the number of passengers.\n\nFor daytime journeys, we provide a Mercedes-Benz Vito for up to 4 hours. For lunch, we arrange a 45-seat coach for 2 hours, from 12:30 to 14:30, including waiting time for the group.\n\nAn English-speaking transport coordinator assists with airport departures. We provide 3 bottles of water per participant. Vehicle pick-up times are agreed according to your flight tickets.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-d41641341913",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The RU narrative omits the Word's named flight numbers and fixed pick-up times and adds ticket-based coordination; this complete adapted passage is absent from Word. Preserve the assigned RU scope, vehicles, capacities, hours and water allowance."
      }
